WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:03.442
It was Mo's birthday.

2
00:00:03.443 --> 00:00:06.748
Cora decided to have a surprise party.

3
00:00:06.749 --> 00:00:10.264
"I'll invite Mo's friends," she thought.

4
00:00:10.265 --> 00:00:15.597
"It will be fun!"

5
00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:21.279
Cora decorated her den with sea glass.

6
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:26.734
She made bowls of seaweed snacks.

7
00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:34.050
"Everything is ready!" she thought.

8
00:00:34.051 --> 00:00:39.384
The plankton were the first guests to arrive.

9
00:00:39.385 --> 00:00:42.790
"We brought Mo a present," they said.

10
00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:46.119
They showed Cora some pretty pebbles.

11
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:49.836
"He'll love them!" Cora said.

12
00:00:49.837 --> 00:00:55.818
Sasha swam to Cora's den and looked around.

13
00:00:55.819 --> 00:00:58.974
"Am I too early?" she asked.

14
00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:04.074
"You're right on time," Cora said.

15
00:01:04.075 --> 00:01:08.278
Soon all of Mo's friends were there.

16
00:01:08.279 --> 00:01:12.509
"Rita will arrive with Mo soon," Cora said.

17
00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:16.797
"We can hide and shout, 'Surprise!'"

18
00:01:16.798 --> 00:01:21.290
Everyone started to hide.

19
00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:26.264
Some hid behind rocks.

20
00:01:26.265 --> 00:01:31.553
Others hid in the sand.

21
00:01:31.554 --> 00:01:40.253
"Shh, here come Mo and Rita!" Cora whispered.

22
00:01:40.254 --> 00:01:44.091
Cora changed colors to hide in some rocks.

23
00:01:44.092 --> 00:01:48.430
"Mo will love this surprise!" she thought.

24
00:01:48.431 --> 00:01:51.254
Rita swam in first.

25
00:01:51.255 --> 00:01:54.746
Cora waited for Mo to follow.

26
00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:58.887
But Mo wasn't with Rita.

27
00:01:58.888 --> 00:02:03.919
The ray looked worried. "Help, Cora!

28
00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:09.169
Mo is missing!"

